      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@ZKDID_ @agustinenada Here is the real rub, by number only 12.37% of DReps voted.  But those 116 DReps represent 3.5 Billion in ADA voting weight.  11.9b total - 6.31b abstained = 5.59b active ADA \n116 DReps = 3.5b or ~62% active stake https://t.co/svgEgiIkS9",
