      "full_text" : "@Justin_Bons @Cerkoryn All prams are subject to change through  Cardano’s governance system.  When the need arises there will be advocates for a change.  I don’t think this is fully understood as on onlooker.  When participating it’s clear this chain is doing something totally different with governance",
