      "full_text" : "@planetmaaz I think there is a lot of misunderstanding maybe misinformation being thrown around.  There was no requirement for the current budget process, it was simply a facilitation of a process.  Anyone has always been free to submit outside of @IntersectMBO.\n\nNot hard to grasp IMO. 🤔",
