      "full_text" : "Do you think the Ekklesia budgeting temperature check need be threshold reliant?  The total votes is less than 10% of registered DRpes, currently. 74 total votes out of ~900 registered DReps possibly ~600 still active.   I would say it’s underrepresented and therefore unclear.",
