      "full_text" : "@InputEndorsers @MicheleHarmonic @IntersectMBO That’s very true.  I hope @IntersectMBO can shake off the cloak of is founding and develop its own brand identity.  Embraced and supported by the community.  It was always ment to be pre-seeded and then turned over through elections and rotations to the community.",
