      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@cardano_whale @RockyBCAW @stakenuts If you have never been broke or hungry you just will never understand the difference.  Maybe 🤔 this chain is destined to be governed by a the patrician class.  And we have done nothing new, but digitized and codified the fallings of the past.",
