      "full_text" : "@cardano_whale @RockyBCAW @stakenuts Economic circumstances are not equivalent at all.  Some live paycheck to paycheck at $25 hr.  Some make $500 hr with investment security and savings.  Those two don’t see time the same way.  Don’t work don’t eat is not equivalent to don’t work 🤷🏻 little no fallout.",
