      "full_text" : "@eternlwallet @NicolasC3rny How would a standardized rational be better than none at all.  I don’t follow?  If the idea is to fullfill a “requirement” rather than provide meaningful insight to the proposer or delegates, that’s a disservice to both IMO.   \n\nLet’s not sanitize DRep responsibility into CPAs",
