      "full_text" : "@BobBochsler @davidsirota I feel like there is a lot to unpack here.  For instance what about stables in custody generating yields.  Or stable held at the bank but issued by an alternative entity.  Like are stablecoin deposits FDI insured and also have priority.  \nWhy would a banks hold fiat at all?",
