      "id" : "1927719021945717006",
      "in_reply_to_status_id" : "1927719018527359346",
      "created_at" : "Wed May 28 13:30:04 +0000 2025",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "My wrote a book 📕 \n\nAs We Begin: Dispositions of Mind, Learning, and the Brain in Early Childhood\n\nThe Learning &amp; the Brian did a blog post on the book, and the quote felt relevant in so many ways. \n\nSo much of what we are doing today will ripple forever \n👀Cardano governance👀",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "jonahkoch",
      "in_reply_to_user_id_str" : "16304821"
    }
  },
