      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "“Sometimes the person with the least ADA has the most skin in the game.”\n\nThis is a fundamental question i have with the concept of PoS, 1c1v governance.  Being early (buying ADA) is most influential.  Will all those that buy in at higher prices really have less skin in the game? https://t.co/zjh4g4Gffy",
      "lang" : "en"
    }
