      "full_text" : "@Cerkoryn 1. Temperature check\n2. Off chain vote \n3. On-chain vote on the results of off chain vote.\n4. On-chain vote of the wording of the action\n5. Final vote on the outcome of the action.\n\n15 months later nobody remembers\n\ndoes that sound about right?",
      "lang" : "en",
