      "full_text" : "@expressive_void @ItsDave_ADA @TapTools I’m looking more long term and thinking about how the network will sustain itself.  If you realize that &gt;90% of the value you’re receiving as staking rewards are inflated emissions taken from a premine reserve then you see it’s unsustainable long term.  Need transaction volume.",
