      "created_at" : "Sun May 04 12:57:42 +0000 2025",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@NicolasC3rny @InputEndorsers @IOHK_Charles @InputOutputHK The actions taken by founding entities will inform other enterprise actors what is acceptable, ie. exchanges, nation states, and fortune 500 companies.  \n\nVoting with self interest using customers funds is actives we are all only hoping doesn’t happen.  There are no guardrails.",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "jonahkoch",
      "in_reply_to_user_id_str" : "16304821"
    }
  },
