      "full_text" : "Just abstain bro,\n\nWhat i find most illuminating, the “what if” questions are mute now.\n\n“What if a Binance does…”\n“What if a nation state does…”\n“What if a 🐳 uses their weight to get money from the treasury….” 🫠\n\nIt’s time to test 🦐🐟 coordination\nThe irony is 😵 deafening https://t.co/QuEPlIQJlY",
