      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "2/2\n\n- Surviving black swans often comes down to acting fast\n- Building in public pays off (longer than trades do)\n- Emotion = biggest risk\n- There is no “final form” - just better mistakes",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "jonahkoch",
      "in_reply_to_user_id_str" : "16304821"
    }
  },
  {
    "tweet" : {
