      "id" : "1917906101468631186",
      "created_at" : "Thu May 01 11:37:02 +0000 2025",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "1/2 Copy 🍝\n\nIn my 12 Years of Tuition Fees at crypto school I learned:\n\n- Being early is not everything\n- Taking profit &gt; feeling clever\n- Diversifying doesn't matter if it's all in one sector\n- Don’t farm the same edge after the market shifts\n- If it feels off, it is",
      "lang" : "en"
