      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@benohanlon Like Yuta has more merit than Maureen because of delegation value?  Or are there more nuanced measurements we can use.  This is idea is further polluted by the concept of preferential attachment when people flock to power to ensure relevance rather than bolstering underdogs.",
