      "created_at" : "Tue Apr 29 14:27:27 +0000 2025",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@benohanlon Just be sure everyone being judged by that meritocracy all are on a level playing field.  I believe that meritocratic system are flawed because they are built on the premise of an equal basis which does not exist in reality.\nMichael Sandel’s work Tyranny of Merit explains why.",
