      "full_text" : "@Jane14457995 @JoriPLevy Just want to mention that currently almost all of not all L1 rely on emissions for security.  Not BTC, ETH, or even Solana survive on Tx fees alone.  This is the achilles heel of blockchain security model.  None have enough tx fees or volume to sustain without emissions.",
