      "created_at" : "Sun Apr 27 23:41:57 +0000 2025",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@AdamRusch @tsnnst @adamKDean @seiduziblim @JaromirTesar @NicolasC3rny @gm_cardano @yuta_cryptox @dannyribar @planetmaaz @benohanlon The timeframe of the NCL and the budget can be found in conflict? \n\nWhat about a contraction in spending like a NCL is approved a budget goes through and a treasury withdrawal takes place, but then within the 72 epochs a new lower NCL is passed.  What happens then?",
