      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@mr_cata @benohanlon The new NCL of 200 million only cover until the end of 2025 ~24 epochs \n\nThe current active NCL of 350 million covers ~72 epochs.\n\nIn my mind the new NCL is establishing a higher burn rate because of the compressed time frame.  Smaller number doesn’t always mean less spending.",
