      "created_at" : "Sun Apr 27 13:46:08 +0000 2025",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@intertreeJK @Jane14457995 @Cerkoryn @ThomasNordicADA I believe also only having SPOs voting was problematic for separation of concerns.  \n\nSimply relating to only an SPOs lack of support for governance activities, that is a bit reductive IMO.",
