      "full_text" : "@intertreeJK @Jane14457995 @Cerkoryn @ThomasNordicADA I recall SPO having some complaints about voting with cold keys and not wanting to touch them unless absolutely necessary, What happens to that concern?  I see many SPOs make NCL votes that have zero impact on outcomes.  Has something been updated making SPO voting more likely",
