      "truncated" : false,
      "retweet_count" : "0",
      "id" : "1915952290944426221",
      "in_reply_to_status_id" : "1915952288377585923",
      "created_at" : "Sat Apr 26 02:13:17 +0000 2025",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "Is the intention to use the treasury to increase staking rewards (lower taxes) sometime in the future?\n\n~320 million ADA deposited every 72 epochs  \n \nNCL 200 million\n\n120 million ADA added to treasury from reserve.\n\nWhat’s the ADA for?\n\nCardano != personal/business finances",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "jonahkoch",
      "in_reply_to_user_id_str" : "16304821"
    }
  },
