      "full_text" : "@Hornan7 @ZKDID_ @NicolasC3rny @intertreeJK i see the pram is currently set at 6 epochs but could be lower if pram change is done, therefore current life cycle is ~30 days.  That means the current NCL will expire before any govAction treasury withdrawal happens.  \n\nBut not necessarily before a budget infoAction",
