      "full_text" : "@ZKDID_ @NicolasC3rny @intertreeJK @Hornan7 I don’t think so, but if a budget is accepted and withdrawal govAction is approved then setting an additional NCL wouldn’t have any effect, because funds have been withdrawn.\nThere are a few other scenarios that could play out, with how the of ⏱️ each action interplay",
