      "full_text" : "@KpunToN00b @intertreeJK @Hornan7 There is a difference between what can be enforced on chain and what needs to be addressed at the social layer.  Ethics where deemed only adequately enforced on the social layer, so the solution is name and shame and get delegates to move away from unethical actors",
