      "full_text" : "@TomDKirkpatrick @CardanoSaint @cardano_whale I think the problem is that forces of centralization need to be actively resisted, because the natural state is centralized in this kind of system.\nSmall weighted wallets will flock to larger weighted DReps, so their weight will have impact.  This is the mental rationale.",
