      "full_text" : "@Jane14457995 @The_cryptobear @MicheleHarmonic @Breezy_Bangs @BeRewt Some level of MEV is apparently good for markets as it makes them more efficiently priced, but I don’t think the benefits are worth the cost to users.\nValidators like MEV because it’s more lucrative for them, so it’s a hard nut to crack.",
