      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@ToddAlgo @ItsDave_ADA @BenTodar Like what happens if some later tries to exit with the erc-20(frozen) USDCx via Circle attestation after unknowingly trading for it, it’s not marked as frozen on Cardano as far as I know.  \n\nKinda wild IMO",
      "lang" : "en",
