      "full_text" : "@ToddAlgo @ItsDave_ADA @BenTodar The ERC-20 side is compliant and can be frozen.  Make for interesting results one could mint USDCx and be unable to exit Cardano as USDC, because of attestation denial Circle (freeze) but they could swap on Cardano and exit as something else like wBTC, USDM.\n\nThe og USDCx is 😵?",
      "lang" : "en",
