      "full_text" : "@NicolasC3rny Decision making enthusiasm wanes as voting fatigue and IRL conflicts continue to increase, and we are just taking the very first baby steps.  That paired with multiple governance positions due for rotation in only a few months with lackluster candidate turnout at the moment 😅",
