      "in_reply_to_status_id" : "1905368176776352024",
      "created_at" : "Thu Mar 27 21:34:02 +0000 2025",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@Hornan7 @ThomasNordicADA @ADAFrog_Pool @jrv97_velazquez @Bitcows @AdamRusch @intertreeJK @Orbital_Lexicon @ATADA_Stakepool @adamKDean @RichardMcCrackn @coc_space I believe the intent is to help facilitate the process without interference, so I would support the idea of having individual govActions for each CC entity.  They could all be proposed within the same epoch window to make voting easier",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "Hornan7",
      "in_reply_to_user_id_str" : "1442487058862276608"
