      "full_text" : "@Hornan7 @ADAFrog_Pool @jrv97_velazquez @Bitcows @AdamRusch @intertreeJK @Orbital_Lexicon @ATADA_Stakepool @adamKDean @RichardMcCrackn @coc_space It’s an interesting case,“what if candidates sit on multiple committees put up for a CC membership” \nThis is particularly troublesome as identity is only opt-in.  I have made suggestions to have probing questions in the signup form.  Like SPO credentials, DRep certificates etc.",
