      "full_text" : "@masatoalexander @AndrewC13535698 Yes, I agree. not worth the effort.\n\nImmutable data types are inherently more transparent, and i like the determinism, here security is optimized over expressiveness \n\nI prefer to have assets attached to UTxOs in my wallet, rather than pointing to a position in a smart contract.",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "masatoalexander",
      "in_reply_to_user_id_str" : "1339409778934599680"
    }
