      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@AndrewC13535698 The Core Issue: EVM's Architecture\n▪️ Assets in EVM are just data in smart contracts.\n▪️ No standardization. Every contract has its own rules.\n▪️ Result? Vulnerabilities like the Curve hack.",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "jonahkoch",
      "in_reply_to_user_id_str" : "16304821"
    }
  },
