      "full_text" : "@AndrewC13535698 EVM's 2023 Report Card: Grim\n▪️ Q1 saw losses of $222M from flash loans &amp; oracle manipulations.\n▪️ Binance Smart Chain, an EVM chain, had 139 incidents in just Q1.\n▪️ Curve Finance, a major DEX on Ethereum, lost a staggering $70M in July.\n\nI’m not doing your homework but  here",
      "lang" : "en",
