      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@mikerogero No im not talking about KYC necessarily, i don’t advocate for IRL doxxing, because that’s dangerous.  I’m talking about Cardano blockchain related stuff, wallets, activities, committees membership, Catalyst funding,  \n\nI’m not talking about age and addresses etc.",
