      "created_at" : "Sun Mar 16 13:10:29 +0000 2025",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@mikerogero I’m fully aware that we won’t have a 100% reliable solution for some time, but even getting 1/2 way there is better than where we are now, it’s still just “trust me bro” and then postmortem we can verify on-chain, because that’s too late IMO.",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "jonahkoch",
      "in_reply_to_user_id_str" : "16304821"
    }
  },
