      "created_at" : "Sun Mar 16 13:07:25 +0000 2025",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@mikerogero I would use a combination of wallet tracking + social media paring + options-in disclosures.  \n\nWallets tracking to see association and attempts at obfuscation or relationships.\nSocial media presence to verify liveliness\nOpt-in disclosure so we can see how honest they are.",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "mikerogero",
      "in_reply_to_user_id_str" : "15685559"
    }
  },
