      "created_at" : "Sun Mar 16 13:00:47 +0000 2025",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@mikerogero The ecosystem is currently sufficiently small enough to allow for social KYC and wallet tracking to a least begin to mitigate the sibyl impacts.  Just accepting the status quo is very naïve, because as the ecosystem becomes wealthier it will attract more malicious actors.",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "jonahkoch",
      "in_reply_to_user_id_str" : "16304821"
    }
  },
