      "full_text" : "@mikerogero Your 100% correct the pseudo anonymity is a difficult nut to crack and i understand we are in a minimum viable governance environment, but my complaint is that we are progressing as if these issues don’t matter much.  We we need to be working on tooling and solutions now.",
