      "full_text" : "@ErreMujico @__fallen_icarus @AGoCorona Yes, the concurrency issue really only happens at the best prices, which is already subject to slippage in current models so why not just make bid and asks outside of best price and contention eases out, for the P2P swap, high frequency trading can happen one layer up + batchers",
