      "created_at" : "Sat Mar 15 14:47:24 +0000 2025",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "This is an example of just one of many flaws in the Cardano governance model.  The whole thing is still just “trust me bro” \nAll top DReps are also SPOs and some are also CC members.  There are no guardrails for separation of powers/concerns.  It’s just smoke and mirrors. https://t.co/Vtyz7BUehW",
