      "retweet_count" : "0",
      "id" : "1891288684621643950",
      "in_reply_to_status_id" : "1891286722157117808",
      "created_at" : "Mon Feb 17 00:48:55 +0000 2025",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@ElderM It’s possible protocols like Minswap would also be in charge of management of the funds, is that the thinking here?  I support the idea of native stablecoin liquidity infusion.  I just need to understand how management is done without seeding power to entities by giving them ADA",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "jonahkoch",
      "in_reply_to_user_id_str" : "16304821"
    }
  },
