      "created_at" : "Mon Feb 17 00:41:07 +0000 2025",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@ElderM I was thinking about the fees that are charged by defi protocols like Minswap, and the stablecoins themselves like Moneta for minting and burning.  Would the treasury and by extension the ecosystem be paying those fees associated with swapping, minting, and burning of assets?",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "ElderM",
      "in_reply_to_user_id_str" : "1662093304295456769"
    }
  },
