      "full_text" : "@ElderM I like the concept, but I saw no mention of fees?  Don’t all the DeFi protocols and stablecoins have profit from the fees associated with activities.  This would need to be addressed IMO. We would be providing profits to Defi protocols at the expense of funding other projects.",
