      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@Gnobudyspecial @IntersectMBO Nope, it was a surprise to them as well. Pretty wild example of permissions-less governance in practice.  In reality anyone can submit a treasury request at any time, without a budget even.  It would be up to DReps and CC to decide yea or nay",
