      "full_text" : "@NicolasC3rny Have we fumbled the ball?\n\nIf budget needs NCL definition before approval, but tau can be adjusted after budget approval, so haven’t we enabled a vector for malicious intents.  \n\nYes it would require coordination of voting weight, and maybe not likely.\nThoughts 💭",
