      "full_text" : "@bobcorn_ada I just wanted to point out that we have more options available to submit budgets even if a single massive one is approved.  We need to balance NCL with expectations and requirements",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "bobcorn_ada",
      "in_reply_to_user_id_str" : "1294436943736918016"
    }
  },
