      "full_text" : "@bobcorn_ada There are some misconceptions about how treasury withdrawals are initiated.  Attending @Hornan7 lessons on SanchoNet were instrumental in understanding the transcription that are actually submitted, the budgeting process is socializing not node rules.",
      "lang" : "en",
