      "full_text" : "@adamKDean It’s about everything from IntersectMBO to single SPOs running unprofitable businesses.  \nWe need to release ourselves from the scarcity mindset we have the ability to generate revenue if we can increase activity this will not happen if everyone is broke hordes funds",
