      "created_at" : "Sun Feb 09 14:19:44 +0000 2025",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "NGL feels like this a lot of the time.\nWhy having an ecosystem full of broke volunteers is beneficial to Tx volume and TVL is beyond me.  \nMy unpopular opinion is we shouldn’t be so cheap and incentivize participation that what other ecosystem do and they are winning. https://t.co/1dT1ySX5rp",
