      "created_at" : "Fri Jan 31 13:09:20 +0000 2025",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@FredGregaard There is no way to enforce a restriction on triple or double dipping.  Any restrictions would be a social contract and this can already be addressed socially, “name and shame” is the only way to prevent this, by getting delegates to ostracize such actors",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "FredGregaard",
      "in_reply_to_user_id_str" : "1813051708299509760"
    }
  },
