      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@NicolasC3rny @Cardano_CF @IntersectMBO @RichardMcCrackn @AdamRusch @Jennycitalinda @BeatriceAnihiri @ADAFrog_Pool @adamKDean @bigpeyYT Good, I have a follow up question, if the govAction is say 5 epochs and I vote in the first epoch, but gain ADA delegate by say the 4th epoch.  What weight will my vote carry?  Final weight at the end of govAction period, or weight at time of the voting transaction?",
