      "full_text" : "@SynthLuvr Your missing my point, I understand nobody cares where the Tx volume comes from.  That’s irrelevant, what is not is the fact that Cardano doesn’t have the ability to exploit MEV and thus will need organic Tx volume to increase to even reach the baseline Tx volume on MEV chains.",
