      "created_at" : "Sat Jan 04 13:11:41 +0000 2025",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@kostas_panagias The value of ADA in fiat is definitely an obstacle as the price increases.  This is true for everything from Tx fees to infoAction/govAction deposits set at 100k.  \nSome thoughts, the value will fluctuate we have already seen $3 and $0.24 what number between those two do we take?",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "kostas_panagias",
      "in_reply_to_user_id_str" : "97803921"
    }
  },
