      "full_text" : "@kostas_panagias @yuta_cryptox I’m thinking about the same thing.  We need a lot of development in the short term 3-5 years to get scaling done addition node client etc. To assume all years have the same requirements on the treasury is shortsighted IMO.  With accountability we can make more flexible decisions.",
