      "id" : "1868700867647750227",
      "created_at" : "Mon Dec 16 16:53:00 +0000 2024",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "The time to ask “someone to do something” is over, gone, and finished.  It’s time to state what you’re going to do, to make the changes you want, by finding consensus amongst your peers.  Charles cannot save us, CF cannot control our future.  It’s time to take control ourselves.",
      "lang" : "en"
    }
