      "full_text" : "@0xNLYFANS @CryptoGnojek This was a real wake up call to ADA holders and liquidity providers.  I never really deployed any ADA due to gov and stake custody by protocols.  That’s why DeFi Kernel is so interesting.  I would love to participate in something P2P like that with full custody or the asset",
