      "full_text" : "@MicheleHarmonic @Cerkoryn Because contacting a few whal DReps can look like collusion.  We need transparency and onchain veracity.  All this offchain negotiations is sus.  We did a disservice to the process by removing BIA.  It was short sighted and naivety to think it was going to improve the quality",
