      "full_text" : "@MicheleHarmonic @Cerkoryn And in there lies the problem 😭 \n\nIndividually reaching out doesn’t change the proposal that’s submitted.  We can only judge what’s presented on-chain.  Back room DMs and X posts don’t make for reasonable disclosure or discussions.  \n\nIf a proposer feels rejected by DReps 😵",
