      "full_text" : "@MicheleHarmonic @Cerkoryn We need to remember that “no” votes are not a rejection but the only means of negotiating with the proposal, since we have no budget info_action requirement prior to TWA.  This is a consequence of Constitution v2.4 \n\nIt’s not appropriate to expect one and done proposals 😔",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "MicheleHarmonic",
      "in_reply_to_user_id_str" : "1469016401046351878"
    }
  },
