      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@VivalaCoinBTC Plutocracy is always going to be an issue in PoS, I would like to see tooling that makes crowdsourcing cooperative easier and frictionless.  Like how do 10,000 wallets holding 1000 ADA each coordinate together to create a voting block.  This tooling will be useful.",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "VivalaCoinBTC",
      "in_reply_to_user_id_str" : "1360292871488831489"
    }
  },
