      "full_text" : "@MinswapIntern @IagonOfficial @OptimFi @zygomeb It’s great that @zygomeb is pushing the narrative because it’s a reality that we all need to be aware of.  What’s also an interesting perspective is to be used for good in countering a malicious whale or DAO.  Double edged sword can cut both ways.",
